   "20": {
    "original": "Like any traditional matchmaker, Andersen screens her candidates for marital history, children, political views, and work history, particularly in large tech organizations.",
    "rewrite": "Similar to any conventional matchmaker, Andersen evaluates her potential clients based on marital background, offspring, political beliefs, and employment details, especially those from substantial tech firms."
